      "note": "**Greet** takes its object directly, with no **to**."
    },
    {
      "incorrect": "Please greet your mother from me.",
      "correct": "Please say hello to your mother for me.",
      "note": "In everyday speech, sending a friendly message through someone is *say hello to someone for me*; **greet** sounds stiff here."
